{"ticker":"ODFL","updated":"2026-10-23T23:25:01Z","profile":{"longName":"Old Dominion Freight Line, Inc.","shortName":"Old Dominion Freight Line, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Trucking","country":"United States","website":"https://www.odfl.com","fullTimeEmployees":20173,"marketCap":37995806720,"trailingPE":35.134617,"forwardPE":27.168215,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.7819295,"pegRatio":2.28,"targetMeanPrice":221.14285,"targetHighPrice":250.0,"targetLowPrice":156.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.104,"earningsGrowth":0.323,"grossMargins":0.39566,"operatingMargins":0.28835,"profitMargins":0.19443001,"totalRevenue":5602506752,"beta":1.203,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":252.03,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":126.01,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.61},"summary":"Old Dominion Freight Line, Inc. operates as a less-than-truckload motor carrier in the United States and North America. The company offers regional, inter-regional, and national less-than-truckload services, as well as expedited transportation services. It also provides various value-added services, including container drayage, truckload brokerage, and supply chain consulting. In addition, the company operates fleet maintenance centers. As of December 31, 2025, it owned and operated 10,184 tractors, 30,824 linehaul trailers, and 14,313 pickup and delivery trailers. Old Dominion Freight Line, Inc. was founded in 1934 and is headquartered in Thomasville, North Carolina.","summary_zh":"Old Dominion Freight Line, Inc. 在美國和北美作為零擔汽車承運商營運。該公司提供區域、區域間和全國零擔運輸服務以及加急運輸服務。它還提供各種增值服務，包括貨櫃拖運、整車經紀和供應鏈諮詢。此外，該公司還營運車隊維護中心。截至2025年12月31日，該公司擁有並營運10,184輛牽引車、30,824輛長途拖車以及14,313輛取貨和送貨拖車。 Old Dominion Freight Line, Inc. 成立於 1934 年，總部位於北卡羅來納州托馬斯維爾。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"卡車運輸","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":158.52,"h":158.87,"l":154.69,"c":155.47,"v":1721300},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":154.44,"h":156.59,"l":153.82,"c":154.48,"v":2155600},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":15